{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y_obs`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: the latent state `x` and observation `y_obs` were represented as vectors so that the latent Ornstein-Uhlenbeck transition model can be written as one built-in `multi_normal` prior for the top-level parameter `x`. The mean vector and covariance matrix are computed by the same Gaussian Markov recursions as the original sequential transition statements, preserving the same joint density for `x` conditional on `mu`, `gamma`, `tau`, `x0`, and the time data. The protected observation `y_obs` is then scored exactly once with `normal(x, sigma)`. No data values were added or changed; the JSON array for `y_obs` is valid for the vector declaration.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  real t0;

  int<lower=1> N_obs;
  array[N_obs] real t_obs;
  vector[N_obs] y_obs;
  real<lower=0> sigma;
}

parameters {
  real mu;
  real<lower=0> gamma;
  real<lower=0> tau;

  real x0;
  vector[N_obs] x;
}

model {
  real decay;
  real innovation_var;
  vector[N_obs] x_mean;
  matrix[N_obs, N_obs] x_cov;

  mu ~ normal(0, 10);
  gamma ~ normal(0, 1);
  tau ~ normal(0, 1);

  x0 ~ normal(0, 3);

  x_cov = rep_matrix(0, N_obs, N_obs);

  decay = exp(-gamma * (t_obs[1] - t0));
  x_mean[1] = mu + (x0 - mu) * decay;
  innovation_var = square(0.7071 * tau) * (1 - decay) / gamma;
  x_cov[1, 1] = innovation_var;

  for (n in 2:N_obs) {
    decay = exp(-gamma * (t_obs[n] - t_obs[n - 1]));
    x_mean[n] = mu + (x_mean[n - 1] - mu) * decay;
    innovation_var = square(0.7071 * tau) * (1 - decay) / gamma;

    for (m in 1:(n - 1)) {
      x_cov[n, m] = decay * x_cov[n - 1, m];
      x_cov[m, n] = x_cov[n, m];
    }

    x_cov[n, n] = square(decay) * x_cov[n - 1, n - 1] + innovation_var;
  }

  x ~ multi_normal(x_mean, x_cov);

  y_obs ~ normal(x, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N_obs":4,"sigma":2.049991609335336,"t0":5.619496314967426,"t_obs":[3.765694074093375,2.2901830815088906,2.3600484522194196,2.4718046603240142],"y_obs":[2.0,2.0,4.0,4.0]}","protected_variables":["y_obs"]}
